<title>USA: Poughkeepsie Savings plans holding company.</title>
<headline>Poughkeepsie Savings plans holding company.</headline>
<dateline>POUGHKEEPSIE, N.Y. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poughkeepsie Savings Bank FSB said Thursday that it will form a holding company to be called Poughkeepsie Financial Corp.</p>
<p>And the company said it will undergo a reorganization wherein Poughkeepsie Savings Bank FSB would become a wholly owned subsidiary of the holding company.</p>
<p>The new corporate structure will allow for more flexibility as the bank pursues its strategic objectives, it said.</p>
</text>
